# No one-sided thick borders

Do not design components with a thick accent on a single edge (left rails, `border-l-4`, `w-1.5` gradient strips, or any bar that only emphasizes one side).

Use even borders on all sides, or no border. Soft fills, full rings, and equal-radius cards are fine.

```tsx
// BAD
<div className="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1.5 bg-coral" />
<section className="border-l-4 border-coral p-4" />

// GOOD
<section className="rounded-[22px] border border-line p-6 sm:p-8" />
```
